IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q05-MONTHLY-INTEREST.
*> Monthly interest = (balance * annual rate) / 1200, rounded.
*> Tests: 1000.00 & 5.00 -> 4.17; check round-up and midpoint.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-RAW-BAL          PIC X(15).
01  WS-RAW-RATE         PIC X(10).
01  WS-BALANCE          PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-RATE             PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-INTEREST         PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01  WS-DISP-INT         PIC Z(8)9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-RAW-BAL
    ACCEPT WS-RAW-RATE

    COMPUTE WS-BALANCE = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-RAW-BAL)
    COMPUTE WS-RATE    = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-RAW-RATE)

    COMPUTE WS-INTEREST ROUNDED =
        (WS-BALANCE * WS-RATE) / 1200

    MOVE WS-INTEREST TO WS-DISP-INT
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-INT)
    STOP RUN.
